    narr:narration """Technical infrastructure decisions converge on [analytics pipeline modernization](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1), anchored by the formal adoption of [Zypherion for analytics](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4). Performance rationale rests on benchmarked gains, noting it [handles columnar queries 15x faster than our current setup](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2) with a [15x improvement on columnar queries](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_5). Execution timelines place the transition securely in the near term, with confirmation that [the migration starts next quarter](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3) and [migration starts Q3 2026](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_6), nested within broader efforts around [Transitioning analytics data infrastructure to dedicated columnar engines](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_ColumnarDatabaseAdoptionForAnalytics).""" ;
